        {
          "type": "text",
          "heading": {
            "1": "4. 예시"
          },
          "body": "* 2ˣ = 8 → x = {{3}}\n* 3ˣ = $\\dfrac{1}{9}$ → x = {{−2}}\n* $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{x}$ < $\\dfrac{1}{8}$ → x > {{3}}",
